// KAZM is Class D at 780 kHz: class standard height = 3/8λ = 0.375 × (300000/780) ≈ 144.13 m.
// λ/4 (96.15 m) was previously used here, which underestimated structural loads by ~(144/96)² ≈ 2.25×.
